{"parse": {"title": "The Katana Devil Portal", "pageid": 2219, "revid": 23644, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\"><b>Overview</b></span></h2>\n<p>The Katana Devil Portal Can be Only obtained by doing Tier 5 Devil portals. Finishing a Katana Devil Portal has a chance to give the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Denjy (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGVuank/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Denjy</span> secret unit.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Obtaining_.2B_Rewards\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining_+_Rewards\">Obtaining + Rewards</span></h2>\n<p><b>A Katana Devil Portal has a slight chance to  be obtained when using Tier 5 Devil Portals, which will replace said portal.</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>The drop chance for the secret unit in a Katana Devil Portal is of 100% for the host and 5% for other players who enter the portal</li>\n<li>These portals are currently unobtainable and have been since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#Update_12_-_My_Hero_Academia_Update\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 12 - My Hero Academia Update</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261023135555\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:2219-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261023135555 and revision id 23644. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"